Lead decisions 2026-09-27, dispatched to implementation together with #92:
- gamma 0.999 per game-second (~28 waves);
- about 64 replayed transitions per new decision (about 0.11 gradient steps per decision; D'Oro 2023 bound without resets);
- actor refresh every 100 decisions (Ape-X's 400 frames);
- AdamW eps 1.5e-4 (Rainbow/DER/SPR/BBF);
- replay capacity holds the whole run (DER/SPR/BBF), if RAM allows.
Unchanged: warm-up, batch, n-step schedule, EMA target, PER constants, and the epsilon ladder. Tier C review.
